# Mobile app environment. Copy to `.env` for local runs; never commit real
# values here. Release builds read the committed `.env.production` (loaded by
# Expo CLI during `npx expo export`, which forces NODE_ENV=production) as the
# single build-time authority for release values.

# Absolute http(s) origin of the standalone Hono API server (@ega/server).
#
# Production convention: the DEDICATED API origin, e.g.
#   https://ega-api.egawilldoit.online
# This subdomain REQUIRES DNS/provider setup (Vercel project + domain) and is
# NOT live yet; see docs/architecture/hono-deployment.md for the deployment
# runbook and the Task-5 cutover sequencing before flipping release builds.
#
# When unset in dev, the client derives http://<lan-host>:3000 from the Expo
# dev server host; when unset in release builds the client throws at startup
# (there is no production fallback). Release builds must embed
# https://ega-api.egawilldoit.online via apps/mobile/.env.production.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
